  "Changes": "Stacked DataBar image decoding fits a tilted separator centerline from transitions between checksum-verified data rows. Consistent thickness, distributed support, a three-quarter centerline consensus and the complete encoded separator pattern validate the fallback. Physical layout, payload checks and the existing deadline remain enforced. No public option or runtime dependency is added.",
